Note: Connect the front end in env. and main.ts

Note: Once you deploy to production, run npm run migration:run and npm run seed
        against your production database before starting the server.


Note: Change env. swagger to false, set ssl to true

FornEnd Needs:

        Base URL (http://localhost:3000 locally, or your deployed URL)

        OpenAPI JSON spec (http://localhost:3000/api/docs-json) for auto-generating TypeScript types/hooks

        Seeded test credentials (admin@vetclinic.com / Admin@123) and the auth header format (Authorization: Bearer <access_token>).

Run these commands if using cloud
        npm run migration:run && npm run seed
        npm run start:prod

Final verification:
        npm run build
        npm run test:e2e